    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A new vaccine to protect children against deadly pneumonia and meningitis is being included in the routine immunisation programme by the Government of Sindh from November 10. The pneumococcal vaccine campaign was launched in the federal capital and the Punjab on October 10, followed by Sindh. The campaign will be extended to the rest of the country early next year.",
